# Local-First AI Creative Studio — environment reference.
#
# This file is documentation, not configuration. Copy it to `.env` ONLY for local
# development conveniences such as pointing at a self-hosted FFmpeg build.
#
# ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │ API keys MUST NOT live here.                                                 │
# │                                                                              │
# │ PRD §13 requires every provider credential to be stored in the OS credential │
# │ store (macOS Keychain). The app reads keys through the `CredentialVault`     │
# │ interface only, references them by opaque handle, and refuses to load a      │
# │ `.env` inside a packaged project. A plaintext key in this file would defeat  │
# │ that guarantee and would end up in exports and logs.                         │
# │                                                                              │
# │ Configure keys in the app: Settings → Providers → Add credential.            │
# └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

# Override the FFmpeg/ffprobe binaries (useful for testing a specific build).
# FFMPEG_PATH=/opt/homebrew/bin/ffmpeg
# FFPROBE_PATH=/opt/homebrew/bin/ffprobe

# Vite dev server host, used when developing the Tauri app against a device.
# TAURI_DEV_HOST=127.0.0.1

# Keep the render job console verbose while debugging the export pipeline.
# CREATIVELAB_LOG_LEVEL=debug
